#
# `rv vendors check` compares `git rev-parse HEAD:<path>` with `tree` and fails
# on any difference. A vendored tree is never edited: deltas live in the
# component's `patches` directory and are applied by rvpatch to a build copy.
# `fetch = true` trees are downloaded to `build/vendor/<name>` and verified by
# `commit`; they are never committed, so they carry no `tree`.

